<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Drivva - Luxury Car Rentals</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #1a1a1a;
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        header {
            background-color: #0d1b2a;
            padding: 20px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .logo {
            max-height: 60px;
        }
        nav {
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
        }
        nav a {
            color: #e3b505;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 1rem;
        }
        nav a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
        .hero {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 100px 20px;
            background: url('hero-image.jpg') no-repeat center center/cover;
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 3rem;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .button {
            background-color: #e3b505;
            color: #0d1b2a;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .button:hover {
            background-color: #c49a04;
        }
        section {
            padding: 50px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .fleet, .testimonials {
            background-color: #0d1b2a;
            padding: 50px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .car {
            display: inline-block;
            margin: 20px;
            text-align: left;
            max-width: 300px;
        }
        .car img {
            max-width: 100%;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }
        footer {
            background-color: #0d1b2a;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        footer p {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <img src="logo.png" alt="Drivva Logo" class="logo">
        <nav>
            <a href="#about">About Us</a>
            <a href="#fleet">Fleet</a>
            <a href="#experience">Customer Experience</a>
            <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
        </nav>
    </header>
    
    <div class="hero">
        <h1>Drive Beyond Ordinary</h1>
        <p>Experience the pinnacle of luxury with Drivva's premium car rentals.</p>
        <button class="button">Book Now</button>
    </div>

    <section id="about">
        <h2>About Us</h2>
        <p>Welcome to Drivva, your ultimate destination for luxury car rentals. With a meticulously curated fleet and exceptional service, we redefine the driving experience. Whether it’s for business, leisure, or a special occasion, Drivva ensures every journey is unforgettable.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="fleet" class="fleet">
        <h2>Our Fleet</h2>
        <div class="car">
            <img src="audi-rs5.jpg" alt="Audi RS5">
            <h3>Audi RS5</h3>
            <p>Dynamic performance and timeless design come together in the Audi RS5. Perfect for those who crave power and elegance.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="car">
            <img src="mercedes-g63.jpg" alt="Mercedes G63">
            <h3>Mercedes G63</h3>
            <p>Unmatched luxury and off-road capabilities make the Mercedes G63 a favorite for any terrain.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="car">
            <img src="mercedes-a45s.jpg" alt="Mercedes A45s">
            <h3>Mercedes A45s</h3>
            <p>Sporty, agile, and packed with technology, the Mercedes A45s redefines the hot hatch segment.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="car">
            <img src="audi-q8.jpg" alt="Audi Q8">
            <h3>Audi Q8</h3>
            <p>A perfect blend of luxury, technology, and versatility, the Audi Q8 sets new standards in SUV design.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="car">
            <img src="vw-golf-r.jpg" alt="Volkswagen Golf R">
            <h3>Volkswagen Golf R</h3>
            <p>Performance meets practicality in the Golf R, delivering thrilling drives for every journey.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="experience">
        <h2>Customer Experience</h2>
        <p>At Drivva, we ensure every customer enjoys a seamless and luxurious experience. From easy booking to tailored service, we exceed expectations at every step.</p>
        <p>"Drivva made my anniversary trip unforgettable. The car was immaculate, and the service was unmatched!" - Emily R.</p>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2025 Drivva. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
